<title>SWEDEN: Saab Auto U.S. sales up 3 pct in August.</title>
<headline>Saab Auto U.S. sales up 3 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish carmaker Saab Automobile, which is jointly owned by Sweden's Investor and General Motors, said on Wednesday U.S. sales of its cars had increased by three percent in August to 2,640 vehicles.</p>
</text>
